      "text": "cookies\n---------------------------------\n\nNow it is time to get into the context of \nwhat is cookies and  why they are used in wed dev:\n\nNow when we say cookies :\n\nBe rest assured that we are not talking about the snack\nbut cookies basically a web devlopment slang to \nstore user data on the client",
